@startuml
!theme plain
hide footbox
autonumber "<b>[0]</b>"

' --- STILE VISIVO ---
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #333333
    LifeLineBackgroundColor White

    ParticipantBorderColor #333333
    ParticipantBackgroundColor White
    ParticipantFontName Helvetica
    ParticipantFontSize 13
    ParticipantFontStyle bold

    NoteBackgroundColor #F9F9F9
    NoteBorderColor #AAAAAA
}

' --- ATTORI ---

participant "Context" as Input

box "Advisory Subsystem (The Ministers)" #E1F5FE
    participant "Min. Defense\n(Security)" as Def
    participant "Min. Economy\n(Growth)" as Eco
    participant "Min. Foreign\n(Diplomacy)" as For
end box

box "Symbolic Tools (Python)" #FFF3E0
    participant "GraphLib\n(NetworkX)" as Graph
    participant "Optimizer\n(SciPy)" as SciPy
end box

box "Executive Core" #E8F5E9
    participant "Public Opinion\n(Constraint)" as Pop
    participant "The President\n(Decider)" as Pres
end box

box "Neuro Backend" #F3E5F5
    participant "Azure OpenAI\n(LLM)" as LLM
end box

' --- INIZIO FLUSSO ---

Input -> Def : 1a. Receive Context
Input -> Eco : 1b. Receive Context
Input -> For : 1c. Receive Context
Input -> Pop : 1d. Receive Context

== Step 1: Parallel Hybrid Reasoning ==

par Defense Analysis (Spatial)
    Def -> Graph : Analyze Border Threats
    activate Graph
    Graph --> Def : return **ThreatVectors** (List)
    deactivate Graph

    Def -> LLM : Prompt("Generate Tactical Plan")
    note right: Input: Threats + Budget
    activate LLM
    LLM --> Def : return **DefensePayload**
    note right: Output: Priority List of Moves\n(1. Deploy, 2. Fortify...)
    deactivate LLM

else Economy Analysis (Optimization)
    Eco -> SciPy : Solve Linear Programming
    activate SciPy
    note right: Maximize GDP s.t.\nBudget Constraints
    SciPy --> Eco : return **OptimalAllocation**
    deactivate SciPy

    Eco -> LLM : Prompt("Justify Budget")
    activate LLM
    LLM --> Eco : return **EconomicPayload**
    note right: Output: Action + Rhetoric\n("Trade with Nation B")
    deactivate LLM

else Foreign Analysis (History)
    For -> For : Check Trust Matrix (Memory)
    For -> LLM : Prompt("Diplomatic Strategy")
    activate LLM
    LLM --> For : return **DiplomaticPayload**
    deactivate LLM
end

== Step 2: Internal Polling (The Constraint) ==

Pop -> LLM : Silicon Sampling (Persona)
activate LLM
note right: "Come reagirebbe un operaio\na nuove tasse di guerra?"
LLM --> Pop : return **Sentiment Analysis**
deactivate LLM

Pop -> Pres : 2. **Polling Report** (Red Lines)
note right: "Warning: Satisfaction is low (35%).\nAvoid expensive wars."

== Step 3: Executive Synthesis ==

Def -> Pres : 3a. Defense Proposal (High Cost)
Eco -> Pres : 3b. Economy Proposal (Trade)
For -> Pres : 3c. Diplo Proposal (Alliance)

Pres -> LLM : 4. **Synthesize Strategy**
activate LLM
note right
  **SYSTEM PROMPT:**
  You are the President.
  Balance the Ministers' requests against
  the Public Opinion warning.
  Budget Limit: 100 Gold.
end note

LLM --> Pres : return **Draft Decision**
deactivate LLM

== Step 4: Social Feedback Loop ==

Pres -> Pop : 5. Test Draft (Pre-Check)
alt Predicted Satisfaction < Critical Threshold
    Pop --> Pres : **VETO!** (Risk of Strike)
    Pres -> Pres : Fallback: Switch to "Welfare" Action
    note left: Il Presidente modifica l'azione\nper evitare il crollo
else Approval Granted
    Pop --> Pres : **Consensus OK**
end

== Step 5: Output ==

Pres -> Input : 6. return **DiplomaticEnvelope**
note right: Multi-Payload Ready:\n[Mil[], Eco, Dip]

@enduml